// user document's name field genuinely still has the OLD value. Confirmed:
// the backend's PATCH handler has a real bug in its actual write logic.

// (Upon code review, the bug turns out to be: the PATCH handler was
// updating a local variable holding the user document, but never
// actually calling updateOne() against the real collection at all -
